OL,3,GNEWSAAirline boss felt 'total numbness'
OL,4,Aafter 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn airline boss has told of the shock
OL,7,Fhe felt in the immediate aftermath of
OL,8,Fthe 9/11 attacks and how the aviation
OL,9,Findustry responded with more stringent
OL,10,Fsafety measures.
OL,12,FAurigny's chief commercial officer
OL,13,FPhilip Saunders was working for British
OL,14,FAirways when the World Trade Center was
OL,15,Fhit by passenger jets 25 years ago on
OL,16,F11 September 2001.
OL,18,FSaunders said he was abruptly called
OL,19,Fout of a work conference and saw news
OL,20,Ffootage showing one of the Twin Towers
OL,21,Fon fire.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
