OL,3,GNEWSAAirline boss felt 'total numbness'
OL,4,Aafter 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he felt "total numbness" before
OL,7,Frealising "the huge issues" his airline
OL,8,Fwould need to address in the wake of
OL,9,Fthe attacks.
